<title>NETHERLANDS: Rotterdam airport's cargo rises in 1st half '97.</title>
<headline>Rotterdam airport's cargo rises in 1st half '97.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flown freight traffic volumes at Rotterdam Airport have increased slightly to 1,086 tonnes in Jan-Jun from 1,011 tonnes, in the first half of 1997</p>
<p>Trucked freight volumes also increased to 12,081 tonnes in the first half of this year from 10,577 tonnes in 1st half '96. In June, total air freight volume rose to 278.8 tonnes from 118.5 tonnes in June 1996.</p>
<p>Cargo figures for first half 1997 at Rotterdam Airport</p>
<p>			   Jun 1997  Jun 1996   Jan-Jun 97  Jan-Jun 96</p>
<p> Scheduled air traffic  10.05	4.57	  49 20	 33.14</p>
<p> Charter air traffic   268.75    113.97     1,037.70	978.19</p>
<p> Total air freight     278.80    118.54     1,086.90    1,011.33</p>
<p> Trucked freight     3,380.00  2,916.00    12,081.00   10,577.00</p>
<p> Post total		   n/a	0.32	   0.27	  1.11</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +17 - www.racs.com</p>
